// ── FLAT GRAPHICS: environmental graphic design + window film ─────────────
// A flat graphic is a printed surface applied straight to a wall or a pane —
// Dreamscape wallcovering (EGD) and vinyl window film (WF). It has ONE real
// dimension pair: the overall size IS the graphic. No moulding, no mat, no
// glass, no rabbet, no stretcher bar, and no drop shadow, because it sits flush
// rather than hanging off the surface.
