// text. That's the drawing you present to agree placement, and it has to read the
// same in the editor, the exported SVG, the PNG and the PDF — so the fill, the ink
// and the letter size live here rather than being picked per renderer.
//
// Driven by `editorialContent.wireframe`, which is the SAME flag the Wireframe deck
