// — 102mm is what someone measures on a wall — so it matches how the elevation
// already prints mm as its primary unit. Spec pages keep a finer companion because
// they are fabrication specs where 457.2mm is the point. The two contexts having
// their own convention beats forcing one on both, and each stays internally
