// ── Elevation sidebar tabs ────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Art / Context / Glass. Everything used to be stacked in one column, so the wall
// context and window panels ate the room Add & Arrange and the frame list need — and
// those are the high-traffic ones.
//
// The panes are hidden with display, NOT detached: initElevControls renders into all
// four containers on every state change whichever tab is showing, and a detached pane
// would mean rebuilding it on every switch and losing scroll position with it. It also
// keeps every button findable by id, which several sync paths rely on
// (_syncEgdWallBtn, the context/line tool buttons).
