// for unit-independence. Survives redraws, save/load, and unit toggles.
//
// Dim id formats:
//   spacing-h-A-B   horizontal spacing dim between frames A,B (slides in Y)
//   spacing-v-A-B   vertical spacing dim between frames A,B (slides in X)
